      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>I am a rabbi, and I serve an assisted living community: Rhoda Goldman Plaza in San Francisco. I was inspired by the loving care given to the members of this community, and wanted to acknowledge these workers. I, together with three residents, wrote a prayerbook for our services, <tei:hi rend="italic">Siddur Erev Shabbat</tei:hi> (Kindle/Amazon Direct Publishing, 2020). This prayer, which is entirely my own composition, is included in that prayerbook, and we recite it at each Friday service.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_60405_introduction"/>
